ce:nowrap\">direct</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">memory</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">access</span> (DMA), 512 KB on-chip RAM, USB 3.1 x1, USB 2.0 OTG x2, TSN MAC x3, UART x2, SPI M x2, SPI S x2, I3C x2, I2C x5, NAND x1, SDMMC x1, Osc timer x2, SP timer x2, <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">watchdog</span> x5, GPIO x2.</td>\n</tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Transceiver</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\">PCI <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Express</span> (PCIe) hard IP up to PCIe 4.0 x4 EP and RP <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Transceiver</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">channel</span> count: up to 24 <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">channels</span> at 28 Gbps (NRZ) <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Ethernet</span> IP: up to 6 x10/25 GbE hard IP (MAC, PCS, and FEC)</td>\n</tr><tr><td colspan=\"10\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Package</span> Options3 and I/O Pins4: <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">General</span>-<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Purpose</span> I/O (GPIO) Count, High-<span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Voltage</span> I/O Count, LVDS Pairs5, and <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Transceiver</span> Count</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">B15A</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">80/62</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">80/62</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">M16A</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">40/192/4</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">40/192/4</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">40/192/8</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr><tr><td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">B18A</td>\n<td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">160/52</td>\n<td sty